{"step_index":572,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:29:38Z","content":"I have updated the demo accounts, login matrix, database seeds, and project branding across the entire application to represent **Group 8 (MSU Master Students)**.\n\n### Summary of Changes Deployed:\n\n#### 1. Demo Accounts Matrix Updated (Login Screen)\nThe 4 interactive demo cards on the login page now display your Group 8 team members:\n- **🛡️ Admin (Maviza)**\n  - **Username**: `admin` | **Password**: `Admin@12345`\n  - **Role**: System Administrator (`ROLE_ADMIN`)\n  - **Permissions**: Full Master Authority, exclusive credential revocation, system audit logs, live JVM telemetry.\n- **🏛️ Manager (Takura)**\n  - **Username**: `officer_zou` | **Password**: `Officer@12345`\n  - **Role**: Institution Registrar / Manager (`ROLE_INSTITUTION`)\n  - **Permissions**: Degree issuance and institutional qualification management.\n- **🔍 Verifier (Moses)**\n  - **Username**: `verifier` | **Password**: `Verifier@12345`\n  - **Role**: Accredited Verifier (`ROLE_VERIFIER`)\n  - **Permissions**: Instant verification console, blockchain proof inspection, and AI fraud scanner.\n- **💻 IT Officer (Sandra)**\n  - **Username**: `officer` | **Password**: `Officer@12345`\n  - **Role**: IT Registrar Officer (`ROLE_INSTITUTION`)\n  - **Permissions**: Accredited registrar operations and IT institutional management.\n\nClicking any card in the matrix automatically populates the username and password with visual feedback.\n\n#### 2. Database & User Seeding (`DataInitializer.java`)\n- `admin` full name: **`Maviza (Group 8 Admin)`**, email `maviza@msu.ac.zw`.\n- `officer_zou` full name: **`Takura (Group 8 Manager)`**, email `registry@zou.ac.zw`.\n- `verifier` full name: **`Moses (Group 8 Verifier)`**, email `moses@msu.ac.zw`.\n- `officer` full name: **`Sandra (Group 8 IT Officer)`**, email `sandra@msu.ac.zw`.\n\n#### 3. Group 8 & MSU Master Students Branding\n- **Landing Page (`index.html`)**: Announcement banner and navigation brand updated to **`Group 8 • MSU Master Students`**.\n- **Login Portal (`login.html`)**: Brand header and card subtitle updated to **`Group 8 Academic & Professional Credential Verification System (MSU Master Students)`**.\n- **Dashboard (`dashboard.html`)**: Navigation brand updated to **`Group 8 • MSU Master Students`**.\n- **Audit Portal (`audit.html`)**: Navigation brand updated to **`Group 8 • MSU Master Students`**.\n- **Documentation (`README.md`)**: Updated the demo accounts table to specify **Group 8 MSU Master Students**.\n\n#### 4. QVS AI Assistant Knowledge Base\n- Asking the chatbot **\"How to log in to the system?\"** now outputs the exact credentials and roles mapped to **Maviza**, **Takura**, **Moses**, and **Sandra**.\n\n---\n\n### Verification\nAll 4 authentication endpoints were tested and verified with valid JWT tokens issued:\n- `admin` -> `Maviza (Group 8 Admin)` (OK)\n- `officer_zou` -> `Takura (Group 8 Manager)` (OK)\n- `verifier` -> `Moses (Group 8 Verifier)` (OK)\n- `officer` -> `Sandra (Group 8 IT Officer)` (OK)\n\nThe updated application is packaged and running live at:\n👉 **`http://localhost:8080/login`**"}
